OL,3,GNEWSAPark's #1.8m redevelopment due to
OL,4,Astart
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe #1.8m redevelopment of a Surrey
OL,7,Fpark is due to begin, including an
OL,8,Faccessible playground, a new kiosk and
OL,9,Ftoilets, and a study area.
OL,11,FTandridge District Council leader
OL,12,FCatherine Sayer said the redevelopment
OL,13,Fof Queens Park in Caterham was a "major
OL,14,Finvestment".
OL,16,F"The improvements will make the park a
OL,17,Fmore welcoming and accessible
OL,18,Fdestination for residents and
OL,19,Fvisitors," she said.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
